    "updated_at": "2020-08-19T10:08:53Z",
    "body": "OK fair enough. Whether to know when registration succeeded was raised twice by reviewers at https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/2287304 so I thought I needed to report this, but I'm fine with the current status.\r\n\r\nRegarding the trick I was thinking about, it's basically how you recently wrote your manual tests : regularly try to click to open a link with a custom protocol in a popup or subframe. If you see a redirection, then the registration was approved. If after a long delay it does not happen, you can assume it was rejected / ignored ; so it seems we should require a user gesture for clicking an a element.",
